<title>GHANA: Ghana stock exchange ends slightly lower.</title>
<headline>Ghana stock exchange ends slightly lower.</headline>
<dateline>ACCRA 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ghana Stock Exchange's All-Share Index ended slightly lower on Wednesday after a moderately active session, dealers said.</p>
<p>The index fell 1.02 points to 383.01.</p>
<p>Ghana Commercial Bank was again weak, falling 10 cedis to 510, while Mobil Oil lost 50 to 6,450.</p>
<p>The most active stock was Pioneer Aluminium Factory Ltd, with 300,000 shares traded. The price ended 10 cedis lower at 145.</p>
<p>-- Abidjan newsroom, +225 21 90 90</p>
